{"articleNo":"87764","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=87764&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 U - Startup Contest 개최 공고(-8.7)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.08.02","hit":"3763","attachments":[{"name":"2013 대학창업 경진대회(U-Startup Contest) 공고문[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=87764&attachNo=72607"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생창업과 기술창업의 원천인 대학의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">성공사례를 확산함으로써 대학창업 분위기를 조성하고, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생창업 아이디어 발굴 및</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">창업실패 후 극복사례 등을 공모하여 우수사례를 확산하고자 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">『2013 U(University) - Startup Contest』</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>를 개최하오니 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생창업 아이디어 기획 부문</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> &lt;개인 및 팀&gt;</span></strong></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.1pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 29.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 내용: 학생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">을</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 대상으로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">경제적 가치창출과 연계된 창의적</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">이고 체계적인 창업기획 아이디어를 선</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">정</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 아이디어 예시</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">: 학내 집단 따돌림 감지시스템</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 등</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 신청대상: 학생</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 대학생을 중심으로 초·중·고교생도 가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.3pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청분야: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">분야 제한은 없음(단, 기 사업화되었거나 타 경진대회에서 수상한 아이템(아이디어)은 제외)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 고려사항: 신청과제의 창의성 등 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">창업실패 극복사례</span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> &lt;개인&gt;</span></strong></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -28.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 내용: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">창업(또는 기업 운영)과정에서 발생한 실패를 성공적으로 극복하고 재기한 사례</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '한양중고딕,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&lt;재 창업 포함&gt;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">를 선정</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 신청대상: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대한민국 국민</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 고려사항 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 실패의 범위: 회사의 파산, 영업종료, 상품의 판매 부진 등 신청자가 실패의 범위를 구체적으로 정의</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.9pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재기사례: 정의한 실패의 원인을 논리적으로 분석하고 이를 극복한 사례(과정 및 성과)를 구체적으로 제시 &lt;단, 극복한 사례는 없으나 실패와 원인에 대한 분석이 의미 있는 경우에도 인정&gt;</span></p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></font><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY견고딕'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong>2. 시상규모</strong></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">총 9점, 19백만원</span></strong></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #787878 2pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #787878 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #787878 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #787878 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"30\" valign=\"center\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">시상내역</font></span></strong